  "rationale": "This bundle play targets all 457 reachable customers across six segments to clear the online sell-by gap of 46 units of Khari 200G at Dark store 03. By bundling with Cream 500ML at a price of 86.00 INR, we achieve a net margin of 8.24%, which is above the bakery category floor of 8.00%. The play is expected to clear 42.92 units, recovering 2051.14 INR compared to doing nothing (do_nothing_inr of 1872.20 INR plus play_net_inr of 178.94 INR). This beats a blanket markdown recovery of 1288.39 INR (blanket_markdown_inr of 1109.45 INR plus play_net_inr of 178.94 INR) and is within the tolerance of the best plain markdown recovery of 439.35 INR.",
